# Paid fulfillment content — keep LOCAL-ONLY, never commit to this public repo.
# The site sells these; committing them to a public repo would defeat the
# paywall (reachable via github.com raw URLs). The program SOURCE lives locally
# and is delivered to customers only through Gumroad. build_pdf.py stays tracked
# so the pipeline is reproducible from a (privately supplied) PROGRAM.md.
products/**/*.pdf
products/**/PROGRAM.md
products/**/PROGRAM.html
